			<div class="content" id="post-content-2342379">
									

<blockquote>
<p>several instances of &quot;it is believed that &quot; or &quot;it appears to be &quot; when the &quot;it&quot; in question clearly is what it is</p>
</blockquote>
<p>One can never be certain with this sort of anomaly. SCP-2423-2 is an object locked in unbreakable geosynchronous orbit 2 meters above the floor in a facility that spontaneously materialized out of nowhere. No matter how much it may look and feel like a book, its a good idea to maintain a healthy sense of skepticism about these things. For comparison, <a href="/scp-2540">SCP-2540</a> appears to be a lime. It is entirely reasonable to suspect that SCP-2540 may not, in fact, be a lime.</p>

							</div>

								
